                         :math:`(\text{in\_channels}, \frac{\text{out\_channels}}{\text{groups}},`
                         :math:`\text{kernel\_size})`.
                         The values of these weights are sampled from
                         :math:`\mathcal{U}(-\sqrt{k}, \sqrt{k})` where
